# After the fixture pokes (gen1_fixture_pokes.py) have flown the player to
# Viridian City: into the Pokemon Center, to the Cable Club receptionist,
# and SAVE there (START, 5th item), so the fixture resumes at the counter.
wait 400
holdram UP 1 0xD35E 0xFF 0x29 300
wait 60
holdram UP 1 0xD361 0xFF 4 200
holdram RIGHT 1 0xD362 0xFF 11 300
hold UP 20
wait 30
hold START 6
wait 60
repeat 4
hold DOWN 6
wait 20
endrepeat
hold A 6
wait 90
mashsram A 900
evt saved
wait 120
hold A 6
wait 60
logbytes map 1 0xD35E
logbytes yx 2 0xD361
